	  Backing tests: test_write_service.
	  Notes: Supports the IndexRange to write a single element or a range of elements when the Attribute value is an array and partial updates is allowed for this array; depends on Attribute Write Values so it cannot enable Write by itself. Requires heap (array-valued Write decode uses heap), so it is unavailable on the strictly no-heap MCU tiers (nano/micro/embedded) and defaults off there; a _Static_assert in attribute_handler.c enforces MUC_OPCUA_ALLOW_HEAP.

